 <h3><u>Ghazi paasa</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><b><u><font face=Comic Sans MS size=4></font></u></b></p>
  <p><b><u><font face=Comic Sans MS size=4>Ghazi paasa</font></u></b></p>
  <b><u><font face=Comic Sans MS size=4> </font></u></b>
  <p><font face=Comic Sans MS size=4>Zainab waey jel khanayna raghla</font></p>
  <font face=Comic Sans MS size=4> <p>(ghazi passa kinarehna) x2</p> <p>Khud raghla jel khanayna Zera ayliyam ghamkhwar </p> <p>(ghazi passa kinarehna) x2</p> 
   <ol>
    <li>(Ye dekhe mere in shaano par hai neel rasan ke ghazi) x2 Faryad kare ye behna, haye faryaad kare ye behna, Zera ayliyam ghamkhwar</li>
    <p>(ghazi passa kinarehna) x2 Khud raghla jel khanayna Zera ayliyam ghamkhwar (ghazi passa kinarehna) x2</p>
    <li>(Mei teri sakina ko ghazi, zindaa mei chor ke ayi hu) x2 Zakhmi hai ghamo se sina, Haye zakhmi hai ghamo se sina, Zera ayliyam ghamkhwar</li>
    <p>(ghazi passa kinarehna) x2 Khud raghla jel khanayna Zera ayliyam ghamkhwar (ghazi passa kinarehna) x2</p>
    <li>(Tu hota aghar mere ghazi chinti na haram ki chadar) x2 Bechadar hogayi behna, haaye bechadar hogayi behna</li>
    <p>Zera ayliyam ghamkhwar</p>
    <p>(ghazi passa kinarehna) x2 Khud raghla jel khanayna Zera ayliyam ghamkhwar (ghazi passa kinarehna) x2</p>
    <li>(Kya haal huwa bazaaro mei, bhayi ne sina se dekha) x2 baalo se chupayya chehra, haaye baalo se chupayya chehra, Zera ayliyam ghamkhwar</li>
    <p>(ghazi passa kinarehna) x2 Khud raghla jel khanayna Zera ayliyam ghamkhwar (ghazi passa kinarehna) x2</p>
    <li>(Tu shehr-e-khuda ka beta mei khatoon-e-jina ki beti) x2 kyu bhul gayi ye dunya, haay kyu bhul gayi ye dunya, Zera ayliyam ghamkhwar</li>
    <p>(ghazi passa kinarehna) x2 Khud raghla jel khanayna Zera ayliyam ghamkhwar (ghazi passa kinarehna) x2</p>
    <li>(Mahol sharabi tha ghazi, kufe me gayi jab zainab) x2 aur aal-e-nabi be parda, haay aur aal-e-nabi be parda, Zera ayliyam ghamkhwar</li>
    <p>(ghazi passa kinarehna) x2 Khud raghla jel khanayna Zera ayliyam ghamkhwar (ghazi passa kinarehna) x2</p>
    <li>(Mei awno-muhammad ki lasho par royi nahi hu ghazi) x2 De unka muje tu pursa, haay de unka muje tu pursa, Zera ayliyam ghamkhwar</li>
   </ol> <p>(ghazi passa kinarehna) x2 Khud raghla jel khanayna Zera ayliyam ghamkhwar (ghazi passa kinarehna) x2</p></font>
